				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hello friends.
<br />

<br />
Maybe someone knows me, definitly Sarxas do.
<br />

<br />
Sometime ago a big sadness feltupon Rymer Moondancer, and he begin to fade, 'maybe he was poisned'.
<br />

<br />
Well well acouple of nice Halfelfs begin to heal him and also the kind Dwarfen Paladin Sarxas was helpful in his reborn.
<br />

<br />
And i can tell that the Halfelf adopted him so hard that hi become a Halfelf, not only in apperans but also in behavior.
<br />

<br />
So he started once more to adventure Norrath, He is mostly to find in WK, there hunting for joy and experiences.
<br />

<br />
Alas a lone hunter he want friends to talk to and share experiences with.
<br />

<br />
And he therefor humbly ask for to find a new home under the wing of Concordat Angelis.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
OOC maybe not so good in english but i will try to learn both english and roleplay.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Rymer looks at the moon dreamingly.
<br />

<br />
Aprentice Ranger 
<br />
