			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hear Hear Hear my Friends!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
This most be the happiest day in Sarxas walking around the world of Norrath! There is a part in Sarxas birth into this world that still is not written! He was born and raised in Kaladim and there was an Wood Elf that take care of him most of all in Butcherblock, Rymer who later also was known under the name Rymer Moondancer! Of course there was more Dwarfs and Elfs that cared about Young Sarxas growth and knowledge about the wrold of Norrath, but Rymer was the one who gives me the strenght to go on!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Sadly (as I have told for some of you) something was happening with Rymer Moondancer (Rymer himslef know this part better than no one else)? Posion or what ever but he Died (at least I thought soo) over in Firiona Vie! ? I must say I didnt actualy see you die! my friend. I was there to take over what was left of your armour and treasures from your traveling around the world! Then I left him dying and I was actualy crying in my heart friends, thats a horrible memmory i have, and the last of him!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
But Rymer! You here! You a live! What happen in Firiona Vie? How did the HalfElfs rescue you? Cured you mind but some kind of re born must have happen to you my Friend? OHHH! let us sit down and talk about this I am soo eager to hear your story Rymer? And what happen to our common friend Radek? You remember anything about him? He was there by your side to die he too?
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Friends of Concordat! If anyone is worhty and strive for rightness and honor in Norrath this is the one! I know him as an honorble Elf, not so much for long conversations, Whants much time alone and are sensible for people talking bad to him and his nearest friends!  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
On Concordat Angelis ways, I feel honored that you first of all seek your steps toward us Rymer!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
CHEEER!
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
/Sarxas Siaxovog 
<br />
