			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Sarxas looks at the lizzardman and says: Well then we both have interest in listening to this HalfElf and his story. But maby thats all we have in common Sir Tail! Hope you dont feel too sorry about those Drachnoids that will fall for my steel when the time has come to end there evil lurks under the river, behind the rocks and on the hills with only one purpose: To poison the young adventures that travel from Firiona Vie to your home plains and lake!
<br />

