<br />
Sarxas turn his face to rymer that at the moment stare in the fire, and says: Rymer my friend? I now understand parts of your pain and reborn but please continue and tell us about your first steps from where you know your self as an Half Elf? What has happen and how could we help you in your struggle to a worthy life and your erlier strenght?
